+### `stale-test-patterns.toml` schema
+
+Project-configurable patterns for the `stale_layout_tests` check. Place
+this file at
+`context/skills/processkit/release-audit/stale-test-patterns.toml`.
+
+```toml
+# Globs (relative to repo root) that constitute "tests" for the sweep.
+test_globs = [
+  "tests/**/*.rs",
+  "tests/**/*.py",
+  "**/*_test.rs",
+]
+
+[[category]]
+name = "layout-name-literal"
+description = "Hardcoded v0.25.x layout name as a string literal."
+pattern = '"(dev|focus|browse|cowork|cowork-swap|ai)"'
+# Optional: lines matching `suppress` are skipped (e.g. comments).
+suppress = '^\s*(//|#)'
+```
+
+Each `[[category]]` becomes one WARN-emitting category. The check is a
+no-op INFO when the file is absent, which keeps the upstream skill
+provider-neutral.
+
